IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COMP-DEMO.
       AUTHOR. VALIDATION-PLATFORM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-COMP-SHORT     PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE -100.
       01  WS-COMP-LONG      PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 123456789.
       01  WS-COMP-UNSIGNED  PIC 9(4) COMP VALUE 500.
       01  WS-RESULT         PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LOGIC.
           DISPLAY "COMP DEMO STARTED".
           DISPLAY "WS-COMP-SHORT=" WS-COMP-SHORT.
           DISPLAY "WS-COMP-LONG=" WS-COMP-LONG.
           DISPLAY "WS-COMP-UNSIGNED=" WS-COMP-UNSIGNED.

           ADD WS-COMP-SHORT TO WS-COMP-UNSIGNED GIVING WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "ADD SHORT TO UNSIGNED RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           SUBTRACT WS-COMP-SHORT FROM WS-COMP-LONG GIVING WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "SUBTRACT SHORT FROM LONG RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           MULTIPLY WS-COMP-UNSIGNED BY 2 GIVING WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "MULTIPLY UNSIGNED BY 2 RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           DIVIDE WS-COMP-LONG BY 1000 GIVING WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "DIVIDE LONG BY 1000 RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           STOP RUN.